# Every access by name and by key on an untyped receiver passes the back-end checks in compact code. No site has a cache, so reads and stores go to the lookup tables
# RUN: compile
# OPTIONS: heat=everything-is-cold validate check=validate-back-end limit=MaxSiteCaches:0
# STATISTIC: SiteCachesPlaced = 0
# STATISTIC: SitesWithoutSiteCache >= 2
# LOSS: MaxSiteCaches
# CHECK: image not empty
# PROGRAM-OF: fast.ir
